			"notes": "## Fixes\n- The game no longer crashes when running with REI, and the REI integration of the library mostly works again\n- Resolve [crash](https://github.com/wisp-forest/owo-lib/issues/480) with translation arg unpacker passing a null value instead of empty array\n\n## Additions\n- `BaseOwoContainerScreen` has gained a secondary constructor which allows specifying the texture width and height, since they're now final"
